<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>The God-men’s right to participate in God’s divinity</l><l>Includes God’s image, glorious and bright, shining forth eternally;</l><l>God’s mind! God’s glory! Expressed in Christ, the Word!</l><l>We shall reflect the image of the Son from the Lord, from the Lord,</l><l>From the Spirit of the Lord.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>The God-men’s right to participate in God’s divinity</l><l>Includes God’s sonship made through Jesus Christ, God the Father’s family;</l><l>God’s sons! God’s likeness! Manifested radiantly!</l><l>We shall see Christ, yes, even as He is, and like Him, just like Him,</l><l>Just like Him we all shall be.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>The God-men’s right to participate in God’s divinity</l><l>Includes being born the children of the Lord, even of the God-man gene;</l><l>God’s kind! God’s species! Constitute this realm divine!</l><l>We enter into the kingdom of the Son of His love, of His love,</l><l>Of His love for all mankind.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
